    "reviews": "\u201cThe Spirits of the Kelley Family is the first project of an Italian design team and for this we felt compelled to give it a voice. MoonMonkey's point-and-click adventure manages to present itself worthy, thanks mainly to an interesting graphic style and a plot that at the end veers sharply towards an unexpected epilogue. A pleasant pastime with limited longevity. Especially aimed at lovers of the point and click genre.\u201d<br>6 \u2013 SpazioGames<br>",
